              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anis bineensa lafaa hundaaf, simbirroota samii hundaaf, uumama lafa irra munyuuqu hundaaf jechuunis waan hafuura jireenyaa of keessaa qabu hundaaf akka nyaata isaanii taʼuuf biqiltuu lalisaa hunda nan kenna.\" Akkasumas taʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.30"
